audit-raise-other-level	ex00_raised_output: it sits at robust, above the basic its name gives it, and tools/defs.bzl's _RAISED does not say so
audit-raise-stale	_RAISED names tools/tests/macro_fixtures/levels:ex00_raised_output, which this package does not declare
audit-raise-not-turned-in	OK
audit-raise-note	ex00_raised_output: _RAISED raises it, and it passes its runner --note, a second place to say why it sits above its layer
audit-raise-silent-runner	ex00_raised_output: _RAISED raises it, and its runner (//tools:norminette_test.sh) does not source tools/runner_lib.sh
audit-raise-unlisted	ex00_output: it sits at strict, above the basic its name gives it, and tools/defs.bzl's _RAISED does not say so
