audit-rules-memcheck-diffio	ex00_valgrind: it runs :ex00_diffbin under memcheck, and :ex00_diffbin links //tools:diffio
audit-rules-memcheck-plain	OK
audit-rules-oracle-owned	OK
audit-rules-oracle-subdir	ex00_run_output: the case reads tests/ex00/fixtures/b.txt, in the directory ex00_oracle_fixtures holds to //oracle's records, and none of its --owns patterns (*.txt fixtures/*.map) matches it
audit-rules-oracle-unowned	ex00_run_output: the case reads tests/ex00/fixtures/m.in, in the directory ex00_oracle_fixtures holds to //oracle's records, and none of its --owns patterns (*.txt fixtures/*.map) matches it
audit-rules-oracle-unreadable	ex00_oracle_fixtures: it runs tools/oracle_fixtures.sh, and the audit cannot read its --in-dir-of $(location FILE)
audit-suffix-other-layer	ex00_diff_asan: its name ends in _diff_asan, which is the diff_asan layer's (_SUFFIX_LAYER), and it is tagged asan
audit-suffix-unknown	ex00_frobnicate: its name ends in no suffix tools/defs.bzl's _SUFFIX_LAYER knows
audit-two-layers	ex00_output: it carries 2 layer tags (output, norm)
